INSERT INTO evidence (code, title, description, type, classification, content, metadata)
VALUES ($nxs$EVID-P22$nxs$, $nxs$Register of Marks, Addendum A (Countermarks)$nxs$, $nxs$The restricted addendum to the 1974 Register of Marks listing countermark letters and the authorities they stand for.$nxs$, $nxs$DOCUMENT$nxs$::evidence_type, $nxs$RESTRICTED$nxs$::evidence_classification, $nxj${"text":"REGISTER OF MARKS 1974, ADDENDUM A, RESTRICTED. Countermarks: a single letter cut after the mark. It records an authority that may countermand the holder’s instruments in the bays named. V Bureau of Continuity Records, retention desk (1998). W Estates Office, Annex B. X The Directorate (Oversight), Admin Building main entrance. Y Plant & Heating, sub-basement. Z Treasury Audit, strongroom. Not to be copied.","state":"UNREVIEWED","artifact_type":"DOCUMENT","source":"Research lab terminal, restricted shelf","custodian":"Bureau of Continuity Records","provenance":"Original record; first-hand","date":"1974-06-03","captured_at":"1974-06-03","condition":"NORMAL","image_url":"/evidence/case/1996cda8a26ee5.jpg","thumb_url":"/evidence/case/1996cda8a26ee5-t.jpg","relationships":[{"to":"EVID-P01","kind":"EXPLAINS","note":"Addendum A is the restricted list the Register of Marks refers to."}]}$nxj$::jsonb, $nxj${"node":"P22","reliability":"primary","custodian":"Bureau of Continuity Records","source":"Research lab terminal, restricted shelf"}$nxj$::jsonb)
