INSERT INTO evidence (code, title, description, type, classification, content, metadata)
VALUES ($nxs$EVID-P34$nxs$, $nxs$The Night of 17–18 October 2024, in order$nxs$, $nxs$A timeline table of fourteen events with the record that fixes each.$nxs$, $nxs$DOCUMENT$nxs$::evidence_type, $nxs$RESTRICTED$nxs$::evidence_classification, $nxj${"text":"THE NIGHT, 17-18 OCT 2024, IN ORDER (building time). 17:29 main entrance, figure with bag leaving (CAM-01; guard log 17:28). 18:42 café receipt, cash. 19:32 S01-TUN open/close, no badge. 19:45 CAM-E3, Engineering corridor, figure in her coat. 21:47 seal SQ-24-001 applied. 22:45 lobby clock set (LC-01). 04:15 east-lab camera bank off (ticket MT-24-3302). 04:17 E-LAB-D1 badge and code. 04:20 west corridor: Selim sees Vey being walked toward the Engineering Block (W-CORR-D2 04:20:41; statement \"about twenty past four\"). 04:30 questioning begins, antenna deck (REC-19). 05:00 tower strikes five. 05:52 S01-TUN OUT. 09:40 bulletin MP-24-018. 10:00 disposal under DN-24-107.","state":"UNREVIEWED","artifact_type":"DOCUMENT","source":"Central hub terminal (print)","custodian":"Second set of custodians","provenance":"Derived from other records","date":"2026-09-30","captured_at":"2026-09-30","condition":"NORMAL","image_url":"/evidence/case/1f5cbbfb1b6db4.jpg","thumb_url":"/evidence/case/1f5cbbfb1b6db4-t.jpg","relationships":[{"to":"EVID-P24B","kind":"CORROBORATES","note":"The 04:17 badge read sits two events before the sighting."},{"to":"EVID-P28","kind":"CORROBORATES","note":"The 05:00 strike sits two events after the start of questioning."},{"to":"EVID-P33","kind":"EXPLAINS","note":"List A events appear in order here."}]}$nxj$::jsonb, $nxj${"node":"P34","reliability":"derived","custodian":"Second set of custodians","source":"Central hub terminal (print)"}$nxj$::jsonb)
